SEMESTER EXAMINATION GUIDELINES

Mid-semester examinations carry 30% weightage, end-semester examinations carry 50% weightage, and continuous internal assessment carries 20% weightage. Students must achieve a minimum of 40% aggregate marks to pass a course.

MALPRACTICE & DISCIPLINARY ACTIONS

Carrying mobile phones, smartwatches, or unauthorized printed materials inside the examination hall is strictly prohibited and constitutes a Category-A malpractice, resulting in cancellation of the paper.